<component #resource_core.layered_registry apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" {
  kind = "component"
  behaviors = ["behavior://resource-loading/requirements/layered-effective-registry"]
} [
  <desc ?desc>
  将多个已验证 ResourceTree 按调用方给定的 named layer 顺序组合成 effective registry；只处理显式 shadow/tombstone 与 Kind contract 冲突，不扫描文件、不绑定 host 路径。
  </?desc>
  <runtime ?runtime>
  type LayeredRegistryRuntime = Readonly<Record<never, never>>
  </?runtime>
  <input ?input>
  interface ComposeLayeredRegistryInput {
    layers: readonly ResourceLayerInput[]
  }
  </?input>
  <config ?config>
  interface ComposeLayeredRegistryConfig {
    precedence: "input-low-to-high"
    kindDefinitionConflict: "reject"
  }
  </?config>
  <output ?output>
  type ComposeLayeredRegistryOutput = EffectiveResourceRegistry | readonly ResourceDiagnostic[]
  </?output>
  <pseudo { kind = "ctrl" } ?ctrl>
  校验 layer ids → 低到高合并资源 → 应用显式 tombstones → 拒绝 identity/kind/KindDefinition 冲突 → UTF-16 code-unit 稳定排序 → 计算 composition revision → deep-clone/freeze 输出
  </?ctrl>
]>

<object #resource_core.effective_resource_registry apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" {
  kind = "entity"
  fact_grade = "derived_projection_cache"
  single_writer = "modeling://domain/resource_core/layered_registry"
} [
  <desc ?desc>
  从 ordered named layers 可重建的只读有效资源视图；effective 资源与 shadow/tombstone provenance 同时保留，既不是新的 authoring authority，也不反写任一 layer。
  </?desc>
  <types ?types>
  interface EffectiveResourceRegistry {
    layers: readonly ResourceLayerDescriptor[]
    byId: ReadonlyMap<string, EffectiveResourceEntry>
    byKind: ReadonlyMap<string, readonly ResourceRecord[]>
    kindDefinitions: ReadonlyMap<string, EffectiveKindDefinition>
    compositionRevision: string
    revision: string
  }
  </?types>
  <invariants ?invariants>
  layer 顺序由输入显式给定；absence 不是删除；跨 kind identity 冲突和不兼容 KindDefinition 必须拒绝；机器绝对路径不得进入 revision；revision 是 compositionRevision 的精确兼容别名；compositionRevision 只绑定 identity/presence/layer/shadow/tombstone、选定 KindDefinition resourceId/contract 与 canonical documentUri/logicalPath provenance，不绑定 descriptor/node/metadata bytes；兼容 Kind contract 合并不以 definition resourceId 判冲突；投影不得保留指向调用方可变 record/node/KindDefinition 的引用。
  </?invariants>
  <fact-source ?source>
  事实源是各 layer 的 XNL ResourcePackage 和显式 tombstone 输入；本节点只是 #resource_core.layered_registry 的确定性投影。
  </?source>
]>

<component #resource_core.dependency_snapshot apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" {
  kind = "component"
  behaviors = ["behavior://resource-loading/requirements/resource-dependency-snapshot"]
} [
  <desc ?desc>
  从 effective registry、显式 roots、typed dependency edges 与 digest contributions 构建可复现依赖闭包；不解析任意 ResourceNode 字符串，不拥有 Kind-specific 引用语义。
  </?desc>
  <runtime ?runtime>
  interface DependencySnapshotRuntime {
    canonicalDigest: CanonicalDigest
  }
  </?runtime>
  <input ?input>
  interface BuildDependencySnapshotInput {
    registry: EffectiveResourceRegistry
    roots: readonly string[]
    edges: readonly ResourceDependencyEdge[]
    contentIdentities: ReadonlyMap<string, ResourceContentIdentity>
  }
  </?input>
  <config ?config>
  interface BuildDependencySnapshotConfig {
    algorithm: "sha256"
    missingTarget: "reject"
    cycle: "reject"
  }
  </?config>
  <output ?output>
  type BuildDependencySnapshotOutput = ResourceDependencySnapshot | readonly ResourceDiagnostic[]
  </?output>
  <pseudo { kind = "dataflow" } ?dataflow>
  重新校验全部 effective content identities 并重算 digest → 校验显式 roots/typed edges → 从 roots 求闭包 → 拒绝缺失端点/环/矛盾或伪造 digest → UTF-16 code-unit canonical 排序与摘要 → 输出 immutable snapshot
  </?dataflow>
]>

<object #resource_core.resource_dependency_snapshot apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" {
  kind = "entity"
  fact_grade = "checkpoint_snapshot"
  single_writer = "modeling://domain/resource_core/dependency_snapshot"
} [
  <desc ?desc>
  某组 roots 在一个 effective registry revision 上的不可变资源闭包证据，携带参与资源、typed edges、content revisions 与 snapshot revision。
  </?desc>
  <types ?types>
  interface ResourceDependencySnapshot {
    roots: readonly string[]
    closure: readonly SnapshotResource[]
    edges: readonly ResourceDependencyEdge[]
    registryRevision: string
    snapshotRevision: string
  }
  </?types>
  <invariants ?invariants>
  snapshot 只接受 canonical composer 登记的 immutable registry，只包含 typed edges 可达资源；普通字符串永不产生隐式边；registryRevision 绑定 compositionRevision 与全部 effective content digests；snapshotRevision 再绑定 roots、可达闭包与参与边；snapshot origin 必须独立复制冻结；相同语义输入必须产生相同 revision。
  </?invariants>
  <fact-source ?source>
  事实源是 #resource_core.effective_resource_registry、Kind owner 提供的 typed edges 和显式 authority/material digest contributions。
  </?source>
]>
